### Sign up the admin account
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### Sign in as admin
# @name adminSignin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin1234"
}

### Admin adds a qualification (should work)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/qualifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminSignin.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Advanced Diploma in AI - Software Engineering Technology",
  "firstname": "Kaelyn",
  "lastname": "Johnson",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "completion": "2028-06-01",
  "description": "Centennial College"
}

### Sign up a regular user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Regular User",
  "email": "regular@example.com",
  "password": "user1234"
}

### Sign in as the regular user
# @name userSignin
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "regular@example.com",
  "password": "user1234"
}

### Regular user tries to add a qualification (should be blocked)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/qualifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userSignin.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Should Not Be Saved",
  "firstname": "Regular",
  "lastname": "User",
  "email": "regular@example.com",
  "completion": "2028-06-01",
  "description": "This should be blocked"
}